  m_Name: Level-1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Phrases
  levelBoxPhrases:
  - Trust me.
  - "I won\u2019t abandon you."
  - "I\u2019ll help you get out."
  - Follow me.
  - "You\u2019re safe with me"
  - I know the right way.
  - Just do as I say.
  - "I\u2019m on your side."
  - Trust me one last time.
  - "I\u2019m not like the others."
  - "I won\u2019t lie this time."
  - You can rely on me.
  - "I only want what\u2019s best for you."
  - "One more step and you\u2019ll be free."
  - "We\u2019ll walk this path together."
  levelDeadPhrases:
  - What were you hoping for?
  - You actually believed that?
  - Now get out on your own.
  - Where will you go without me?
  - Did you really think you were safe here?
  - There is no right way for you
  - "It\u2019s so convenient when you obey."
  - No one has ever been on your side.
  - "It\u2019s always the last time with you."
  - "That\u2019s what we all told you."
  - And you believed me again
  - Too bad I never planned to catch you
  - Just not better than what I have
  - "You\u2019ve only become another corpse."
  - Thanks for walking your part.
  levelGoalPhrase: "You made it\u2026 without trusting anyone. Was it worth it?"
